-- Keep positions: what stands where on a keep, as an offset from a component.
-- Keyed on ComponentSkin plus Height, not on KeepID: a keep's garrison is a
-- consequence of its architecture, which is why one row serves every keep
-- built from the same piece.
--
-- Inert on their own. A position is only ever read through a component, and we
-- have none until migration 33.

